title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 12;
card-image: img/international.jpg
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Building ties with our fraternal socialist parties.

=Comintern

At the Comintern, we can forge contacts with our fraternal socialist parties in Europe and across the world.

- @fr_uk: Build relationships with the French PCF and British CPGB to learn from their strategies.
- @oppose_third_period: Despite opsition in the Comintern and our own party, a united front may neccessary in the near future.
- @italy: Learn from the experince of the Italian communists with the fascists.
- @soviet: Expand relations with the Comintern's biggest country, the Soviet Union.
- @lsi: Embed a spy in the labor and socialist international.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@fr_uk
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; left_opposition_dissent -=5 ; marxist_leninist_dissent -=5; right_opposition_dissent -=5; conciliators_dissent -=5; workers_kpd +=5

learning from the counterproductive levels of sectarianism that plagues the CPGB aswell as the labor organizing abilities of the PCF.

@oppose_third_period
subtitle: -1 resources [? if year <=1928 and month <=9: - Maintaining the united front will allow a broarder defense. ?]
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
audio: shuffle music/communist/workers_of_vienna_normalized.mp3
on-arrival: left_opposition_strength -= 5; radicalization += 1; spd_relation +=5

Though capitalism has suffered recent crises, its collaspe is not terminal just yet. we must convince the comintern to maintain the united front.



@italy
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: workers_nsdap -= 4*(1 - dissent)

The Italian Communist Party can educate us on fascism in their own country aswell as helping us agitate among workers to drive them away from the nazis .

@soviet
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources += 1; marxist_leninist_strength +=10; rfb_militancy +=0.3

The soviets offer money and weapons to us, anticipating a revolution soon.

@lsi
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1 ; spd_relation += 5*(1-dissent)

By observing the moderate socialists, we can understand them better and possibly argue for cooperation in the Comintern if we beleive it to be reasonable. 

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
